WEBVTT

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:02.630
I'll gouge out your everything!

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:06.500
Your eyes, your nose,
your throat, and your guts!

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.400
I'll gouge them out with this very hand!

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.560
If that's the best you can do,
you'll never avenge him.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:32.190
Nice try, kitten.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:36.040
When you see your dad on the 
other side, thank him for me.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.760
Damn it...

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:44.560
Tell him Matobai enjoyed every delicious 
drop of his daughter's life.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.470
Kogane-chan!

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:56.660
A-chan...

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:04.770
Trying to help her?
Too bad that's a waste of time.

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:13.760
<b><i>Bubuki/Buranki</i></b>

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:13.800
