Shizuru</b>

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:29.770
<b>Oubu's Right Foot</b>

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:29.770
Bubuki "Tsurarai"

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:31.230
<b>Nono
Hiiragi</b>

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:31.230
<b>Oubu's Left Foot</b>

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:31.230
<b></b>Bubuki "Iwatooshi"

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:32.980
<b>Oubu's
Heart</b>

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:32.980
<b>Kazuki
Azuma</b>

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:33.570
<b>Taneome
Shizuru</b>

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:33.570
<b>Asabuki
Kogane</b>

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:33.570
<b>Kazuki
Azuma</b>

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:33.570
<b>Ougi
Kinoa</b>

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:33.570
<b>Nono
Hiiragi</b>

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:35.240
<b>Matobai
Shuusaku</b>

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:37.360
<b>Arabashiri
Souya</b>

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:38.820
<b>Tsuwabuki
Akihito</b>

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:40.030
<b>Hazama
Zetsubi</b>

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:41.160
<b>Banryuu
Reoko</b>

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:42.450
<b>Tsuwabuki
Akihito</b>

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:42.450
<b>Matobai
Shuusaku</b>

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:42.450
<b>Banryuu
Reoko</b>

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:42.450
<b>Arabashiri
Souya</b>

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:42.450
<b>Hazama
Zetsubi</b>

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:35.960
<b><i>Bubuki/Buranki</i></b>

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:41.950
Hey!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.530
Don't forget our objective!

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:46.500
Let's finish this with Oubu!

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:50.110
Good decision, Leader.

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:51.600
Don't make fun of me!

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.750
Just try it,

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:55.570
if you think you can.

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:58.550
Hey! What are you doing?

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:04.040
Oubu!

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:07.950
What's the problem?

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:09.980
Nothing's happening.

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:11.600
Why?

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:14.550
That'd be because of this.

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:16.040
Is that...

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:18.900
I borrowed it from Reoko-sama.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:20.970
It's Entei's heart.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.160
What?!

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:25.350
You borrowed its heart? Does that mean...

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:31.350
That's right. The legendary 
Bubuki battle has begun.

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:51.960
<b>Nothing</b>

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.290
Hmm.

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:03.640
Typical of you, Sensei.
You haven't lost your edge.

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:05.220
I'm impressed.

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:07.620
Don't mention it.

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:10.660
All I do is sleep my life away.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.020
At least get a phone, would you?

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.570
It's a pain having to hunt 
you down all the time.

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:22.950
If you've come all this way to find me,

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:25.790
that must mean Reoko-sama 
has given her orders.

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:27.280
Exactly.

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:31.760
Matobai-senpai has already 
started a Bubuki battle.

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:35.500
A Bubuki battle... How bizarre.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.350
Oh, that's right!

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:49.080
That little girl you're 
infatuated with is there, too!

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:03.770
He's starting a Bubuki battle now?

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.240
Bubuki battle?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:09.490
I'm supposed to wield the 
Buranki Entei's right hand.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:11.240
That means my opponent...

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.660
is you, kitten.

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:22.630
Kogane!

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.380
You bastard!

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.260
What?!

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.030
Why is this happening? Why?!

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:32.770
That won't work.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:37.730
No one can interfere once the two 
right hand users are locked together.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:41.340
Didn't you little girls know that?

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:44.800
That's fine by me!

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:46.500
Kogane-chan!

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.660
What the hell is a "Bubuki battle"?

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.860
It's an ancient style of duel 
waged for another's Bubuki.

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:55.540
He's trying to take all of your Bubuki.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.460
Take our Bubuki? Why?

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:03.220
The Bubuki we've inherited, 
the limbs of Entei,

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:07.550
were burned to ashes by 
Kazuki Migiwa 24 years ago.

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:12.050
So we're going to take Oubu's 
limbs and use them instead.

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:15.720
I stole this from some other Bubuki user,

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:19.490
but it's not powerful enough 
to serve Reoko-sama.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.470
What's the matter?

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:29.610
Weren't you going to avenge your old man?

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:30.960
Kogane-chan!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:32.570
Just wait!

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:34.790
You heard him.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.770
Once two Bubuki are locked together,

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:39.720
there's nothing you can do 
until the fight is over.

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:41.670
You can't help or interfere.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:43.870
Then what are we supposed to do?

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:47.740
You should depart for the Buranki 
nest as quickly as possible.

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:50.390
Before Reoko's Four Gods come together.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:51.680
Four Gods?

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:54.100
You mean there are three more like him?

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:58.370
Let's go. We have to let Kogane handle this.

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:02.150
This really pisses me off!

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:28.220
What's the matter?

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:32.010
Are you just making that Bubuki 
protect you, like a baby?

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:37.770
Though I do love to see you cry...

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.420
You look much better when you're angry.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:51.650
I won't let you get away with what you did!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:53.090
Not ever!

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:56.020
Nice, nice!

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:59.080
That's what I like to see!

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:01.500
What is this?

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:05.540
This Buranki carrier 
train can get you there.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:09.800
This is a secret station made for 
departures to the Buranki nest.

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:11.860
It can go to Treasure Island?

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:16.570
Yes, but you can't get to the 
Buranki nest without Oubu,

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:19.170
so even Reoko has abandoned the tracks.

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:21.230
The line has been out 
of use all these years.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:26.430
Abandoned or not, wouldn't they 
notice if we used a train?

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:28.820
It's a train for Bubuki users.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.530
The necessary measures are in place.

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:33.360
Now, hurry and get Oubu on board.

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:37.590
I'm going back for Kogane-chan.

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:41.030
Did you not hear a word I said back there?

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:43.370
Even if I can't help her,

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.940
I'm going to watch over her.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:49.000
Even if that means you can't 
go to the Buranki nest?

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:52.920
There's no point in going to Treasure 
Island if anyone is left behind.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:58.180
You're the polar opposite of your mother.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:58.760
Huh?

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.630
Fine. Go on.

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:03.160
Hey! Who said you could decide?!

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:05.570
If he gets killed and we lose the heart,

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:07.880
we won't be able to use Oubu!

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:12.930
Hiiragi, you don't want to 
abandon Kogane either, do you?

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:15.030
Well, no, but...

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:18.810
Then you get the train started up.

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:21.250
That's your job as the leader right now.

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:22.900
As the leader...

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:25.750
Hey, mama's boy.

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:28.420
Take care of Kogane.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.430
Kinoa! Shizuru!

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:34.450
Why are you just standing 
there? Get ready to leave!

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:35.800
Move it already!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:40.720
Horino-san, I have one more favor to ask.

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:42.750
A favor?

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:52.420
That's a nice look! That's a <i>great</i> look!

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:57.630
I want to show that to your 
old man, Asabuki Genma!

00:09:57.630 --> 00:10:00.660
Don't you dare speak my father's name!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.660
This reminds me

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:09.890
of that day ten years ago!

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:19.280
Watch this, Dad!

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:24.490
Good one, Kogane.

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:26.620
All right! I can do that, too!

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:41.200
Wait here for a bit.

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:44.660
Ugh, something stinks.

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.460
Sniff, sniff.

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:50.640
It's the stench of a damn scumbag.

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:55.750
Who would've thought you'd be 
hiding in a dump like this?

00:10:56.300 --> 00:11:00.100
Matobai, are you that determined to finish

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:03.020
our battle as fellow Bubuki users?

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:04.800
That's right, Genma.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:07.940
Until I've settled things

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:12.480
between you, Oubu's right hand, 
and myself, Entei's right hand,

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:15.800
I'll follow you to the ends of the earth.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:26.990
<b>Episode 4
Right Hand and Gun</b>

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:26.990
<b><i>Bubuki/Buranki</i></b>

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.500
<b><i>Bubuki/Buranki</i></b>

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:34.580
I have no business with you.

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:36.500
Oh, don't you?

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:43.370
I don't intend to fight you.

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:44.260
Genma!

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:47.010
Bring out the Bubuki right now!

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:53.020
Then die.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:56.170
Dad?

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:57.270
Kogane...

00:11:58.330 --> 00:11:59.610
Dad?

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:02.990
A child?

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:06.580
Stop!

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:10.750
What?!

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:18.360
Wh-What?

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:19.710
What is this?

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:28.220
You look like a right hand.

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:48.910
Is that... your kid?

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:53.720
Is this why you kept running away from me?

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:58.310
Now, this is a riot!

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.660
So you gave your Bubuki to a little kid

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:09.560
before settling the score with me?

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:10.970
You scumbag!

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:15.690
Go, Righty-chan!

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:23.860
So that's what you look like now?

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:26.380
Raijoudou...

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:30.970
What a pathetic state you've fallen into,
with a brat for your master.

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:33.390
Just stay still.

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:34.760
Righty-chan!

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:37.940
Matobai, let's go somewhere else.

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:40.370
Stay here.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.590
Dad?

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:47.690
Dad!

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:50.920
I'll be back before you know it.

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:03.810
I'll get you out of there, so please!

00:14:03.810 --> 00:14:05.610
Protect my dad!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.870
Why won't they come off?

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:34.340
Dad?

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:40.460
Dad, are you okay?

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.190
Dad!

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:48.330
Please, help my dad!

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:51.570
You have to help my dad!

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:58.000
K-Kogane...

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:00.280
Kogane,

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:04.380
I wanted to go there with you.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:08.480
To this island that Azuma-kun's mom

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:11.800
told us about...

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:19.020
Dad...

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:21.060
Dad!

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:25.020
Dad!

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:32.270
Looks like the duel's over.

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:47.300
Again?

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:51.510
Kogane-chan, are you okay?

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:54.760
A-chan, I'm so mad...

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:57.430
I'm so mad at myself!

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:59.060
Kogane-chan...

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:03.710
Did I not tell you that you can't interfere,

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:05.150
brat with the heart?

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:12.050
It's not as if I'm interfering 
in a one-on-one battle.

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:15.370
I'm only protecting my own life.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:20.370
If nothing else, you're one cunning 
brat, just like your mother.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:22.030
But guess what?!

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:29.490
The source of all power,
 which resides only in Bubuki users' bodies,

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:30.960
is Rinzu!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:36.600
A Bubuki amplifies its user's Rinzu 
to use it for offense and defense.

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:43.210
Right now, that heart is desperately 
putting up a barrier against my attack,

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:47.480
while it devours its master's 
Rinzu to keep it going.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:50.940
So when its master's Rinzu 
starts to run out...

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:55.950
A-chan...

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:01.350
Your Rinzu is nearly spent, witch's son!

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:19.270
Well, what's wrong?

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:21.950
Go on and try to fire your gun.

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:28.360
Do it, and I'll crush your hand 
faster than your bullet can fly!

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:30.380
With my right hand!

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:42.950
Righty-chan!

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:47.540
For crying out loud... 
Stop struggling already.

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:10.480
Azuma! Here's that favor you asked for!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.830
Damn it!

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:20.990
You were keeping the train 
in stealth mode, too?!

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.330
Righty-chan!

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.750
Shit, shit, shit, shit, shit, shit!

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.020
Shit! Shit! Shit!

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:36.520
Admit your defeat, Matobai!

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:43.270
All right!

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:45.170
I give! I give! I give! 
I give! I give! I give!

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:46.360
I give! I give!

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:47.940
I give!

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:54.230
Man...

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:58.380
That would've killed me! Those damn brats!

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:09.830
Well, I did what I needed to do,

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:11.900
my protégé.

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:15.710
A Bubuki battle ends when 
a Bubuki is destroyed,

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:19.560
or when one user dies or 
loses the will to fight.

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:24.350
And the losing Bubuki can't be used again 
until all the Bubuki battles are over.

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:26.480
It's a damn game?

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:32.310
So it's safe to say Kogane won the first 
round of this Bubuki battle, right?

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:34.520
Yes, that's how it turns out.

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:37.780
Horino-san! The train's 
stealth mode won't work!

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:42.450
That bastard landed a clean shot 
on the mechanism with his pistol!

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:47.020
That just goes to show that the 
Four Gods won't go down easily.

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:49.350
What do we do now?

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:51.730
Before Reoko and the others catch up,

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:55.690
we need to find the secret track 
leading to the Buranki nest.

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:02.020
This is the photo my dad had.

00:20:02.940 --> 00:20:04.350
That's Treasure Island.

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:08.630
Dad really wanted to go to this island.

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:13.510
Now I'm going to Treasure 
Island with all of you!

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:16.630
I want to take this photo...

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:20.720
No, I want to take my 
dad to Treasure Island.

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:25.200
Well said, Kogane.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:29.410
I swear I'll take you to the Buranki nest.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.450
Everyone, listen up!

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:35.360
I'm going to the Buranki nest 
to make my ideals a reality!

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:39.040
And under Kazuki Migiwa's banner,

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:42.030
I'll make allies of all 
Bubuki users in Japan,

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:45.280
and destroy Reoko's reign over this country!

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:49.730
Jeez! What's so fun about going to a 
place full of nothing but Buranki?

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:48.780
And then I'll stand at the 
top of all Bubuki users!

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:51.050
And once I make it to the top...

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:53.810
I wonder if there'll be any unusual grass.

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:56.230
I'll create a world for Bubuki users,
made by Bubuki users!

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:54.990
Huh?

00:20:56.380 --> 00:21:00.440
I'm sure we'll find some
unusual foods at the Buranki nest.

00:20:56.480 --> 00:21:00.440
Make sure you all follow me, your leader!

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:04.060
Well, in any case, the train is on the move.

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:07.450
There's no going back now.

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:10.440
Today is the start of your journey.

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:14.210
Keep going straight ahead, like this train.

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:18.300
And don't ever be afraid of losing.

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:29.570
Arabashiri Souya of the Four Gods!

00:21:29.570 --> 00:21:32.850
Hey, if it isn't Horino-chan!

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:36.420
Been a long time! I see you're still...

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:38.060
<i>quite</i> the actress.

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:41.970
Now, why don't we continue 
the Bubuki battle?

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:48.730
I'm the one meant to wield 
Entei's left hand, so...

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:55.960
Hey, the girl with the glasses!
It's been a long time!

00:21:55.960 --> 00:22:01.190
Damn! You've grown <i>big</i> since 
the last time I saw you!

00:22:01.190 --> 00:22:02.960
You've got a bumper crop!

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:07.430
Where the hell do you get off 
showing your face to me?!
